 "id": "z05",
 "text_original": "Grok built this layer. It worked under a written contract, in slices, each logged with a UTC time. It read Zetaris's own agent rules, registered the sources, compiled the semantic layer and wrote the data-quality rules, checking each step against the live API. A later Grok pass added the three newest rules and the one-query profile, and another wrote the independent end-to-end tests. Where it could not verify something, the verdict file says so: seventeen of nineteen checks passed, two were left as not run. Claude Code built the agents and the interface.",
